s capabilities each loop, and challenge deadly foes to Rock, Papers, Scissors as Siffrin seeks the truth.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/in-stars-and-time", "videos": [{"id": 65709, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "NKXgah05RHY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=NKXgah05RHY", "title": "In Stars and Time Reveal Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/NKXgah05RHY/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 75240, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "o5Io1fqLdhI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o5Io1fqLdhI", "title": "In Stars and Time Nintendo Switch Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/o5Io1fqLdhI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 91479, "name": "Gameplay Video", "video_id": "WY29WS9SEYo", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WY29WS9SEYo", "title": "In Stars and Time - Platform Announcement Gameplay Trailer | Future Of Play Direct 2023", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WY29WS9SEYo/hqdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 133826, "name": "Launch Trailer", "video_id": "Glec7uzohbg", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Glec7uzohbg", "title": "In Stars and Time - OUT NOW on PC, Switch, PS4, and PS5!", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Glec7uzohbg/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 133827, "name": "Accolades Trailer", "video_id": "4hOofij5628", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4hOofij5628", "title": "In Stars and Time - Accolades Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/4hOofij5628/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}